{
 "_comment": [
  "REAL, LIVE Congress.gov API v3 bill responses, captured 2026-10-19 with a",
  "working CONGRESS_GOV_API_KEY (story 5.3). Each entry holds the three",
  "responses this loader actually fetches per bill:",
  "  * `detail`     -- GET /v3/bill/{congress}/{type}/{number}",
  "                    (carries `sponsors[]` INLINE, plus title, policyArea,",
  "                     introducedDate, latestAction)",
  "  * `cosponsors` -- GET .../cosponsors  (a separate call; the detail response",
  "                    only carries a COUNT and a url)",
  "  * `subjects`   -- GET .../subjects    (CRS policyArea + legislativeSubjects)",
  "",
  "`bill_with_cosponsors` is H.R. 3424 (119th), the SPACE Act of 2025: 1 sponsor,",
  "2 real cosponsors, a real CRS policy area and 2 real legislative subjects.",
  "`bill_no_cosponsors` is H.R. 1 (119th), the reconciliation act: 1 sponsor,",
  "ZERO cosponsors (the detail response omits the `cosponsors` block entirely --",
  "a real edge case no hand-built fixture would have predicted).",
  "",
  "The only edits are size trims, recorded in each entry's `_live_counts`:",
  "`subjects.legislativeSubjects` is trimmed to the first 3 (H.R. 1 really",
  "publishes 239).",
  "",
  "`bill_original_cosponsor` is the ONE synthetic entry, and is labelled as such:",
  "neither live bill above happened to have `isOriginalCosponsor: true`, and the",
  "role distinction is a documented field of the real API, so it is exercised",
  "here by flipping that one boolean on a copy of the real H.R. 3424 response",
  "(renumbered to 9999 so it cannot collide with a real bill id)."
 ],
